# Kotlin text multifile facade classes have package-private superclass relationships.
# Preserve this package while still allowing class/member obfuscation, shrinking and optimization.
# This avoids the IllegalAccessError seen after repackaging these classes out of kotlin.text.
-keeppackagenames kotlin.text

# OkHttp, Retrofit, Gson, Hilt, Room and coroutines supply their own consumer rules.
# Do not blanket-keep those libraries or the application's DTO packages.
